QuestGuidance.Register("en",378,{
[12065]="7000AE50\n1\tExamine Billina\tBillina is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. Wald Sandson has asked you to see if you can discover what is wrong with Billina.\n2\tTalk to Wald Sandson\tWald Sandson can be found on Sandson's Farm, north and east of Michel Delving. Now that you have learned what ailed Billina, you should talk to Wald Sandson again.\n",
[12066]="7000AE6B\n1\tUse Mound of dirt\030Use Mound of dirt (total: 4)\tScratch at the ground to reveal earthworms in Farmer Sandson's field.\n2\tTalk to Billina\tBillina is in the yard at Sandson's Farm west of Sandson's Fields. Now that you have collected some earthworms, you should speak with Billina.\n",
[12067]="7004A39A\n1\tDefeat spies (total: 8)\tDefeat spies you uncover in Udûn.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many of the Captain of the Pit's spies in Udûn.\n",
[12068]="70026747\n1\tTalk to the Earth-kin at Lehmä-koti\tLehmä-koti lies far to the east of Tinnudir, beyond Ram Dúath. The Rangers have sent you to Lehmä-koti to speak with the Earth-kin.\n",
[12069]="7002E570\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Harsterre\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12070]="7002E54B\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12071]="7002E5AE\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12072]="7002E5A7\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12073]="7004E4BD\n1\tTalk to Aldin\030Talk to Hógur\030Talk to Féli\tLord Náin has asked you to speak to his advisors in Járnfast. You should talk to Aldin, Hógur, and Féli.\n2\tLord Náin has asked you to gauge the opinions of the citizens of Járnfast. You should talk to Járnfast citizens.\t\n3\tTalk to Lord Náin\tYou should talk to Lord Náin, who can be found at his seat in Járnfast.\n4\tFind any sign of the convoy\tThe convoy of weapons was coming from Hammerstead, north-west of Járnfast. You should find some sign of the convoy on the path from Hammerstead.\n5\tTalk to Vílur Strayfoot\tYou have found the weapons convoy sacked, and many dwarves dead. You should talk to the survivor, Vílur Strayfoot.\n6\tTravel to Hammerstead\tVílur Strayfoot has warned you that an attack on Hammerstead is imminent! You should travel to Hammerstead!\n7\tTalk to Lóssi\tHammerstead is under attack by the Easterlings! You should find the captain of the guard, Lóssi.\n",
[12074]="700683C5\n1\tSpeak with the outfitter, Karbah\030Speak with the scholar, Mallax\030Speak with Zerkho\tKhânai made sure you understood that you should speak with the advisors visiting the encampment to learn what is hunted for in the desert and the dangers that the flora and fauna present.\n2\tSpeak with Khânai at the Hunter's Expedition Camp\tHaving spoken with the advisors, you should return to Khânai and let her know that you are prepared to deal with the flora and fauna of the desert.\n",
[12075]="700372DE\n1\tCheck for signs of life among the refugees\tThe refugees can be found on the north-south road that lies east of Marton. You should check the refugees for signs of life.\n2\tThe refugees can be found on the north-south road that lies east of Marton. You should check the refugees for signs of life.\t\n3\tCompleted\tYou have checked for signs of life amongst the fallen refugees along the road, but there are none. Every last one of this party fleeing the Stonedeans has been brutally slain.\n",
[12076]="70021ADC\n1\tApproach the gates of Lhanuch\tLhanuch lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair, in Nan Laeglin. Himeinior has asked you to seek entry into the Uch-lûth village of Lhanuch.\n2\tSpeak with the guard before the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch\tThe guard is at the entrance to the Brenin's Hall of Lhanuch. The guard at the village gate instructed you to speak with the guard before the Brenin's Hall of Lhanuch.\n",
[12077]="70021E85\n1\tTalk to Tûm at Gwaed Brun\tTûm, the elder of the Derudh, is at Gwaed Brun, south of Galar Culch. Enit has instructed you to speak with Tûm, the Derudh elder.\n",
[12078]="7005F558\n1\tTalk to Hersegg\tHersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg, within the encampment of Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn. Hersegg has asked you to accompany her into Mîn Lorg and confront the Iron Crown before they can pilfer anything else from Gloomingtarn.\n2\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost. After thwarting the Iron Crown at Mîn Lorg, you have returned to Watchers' Roost with a curious dwarf named Thrástan—much to the surprise of Hermáth Stormhammer and his expedition. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n",
[12079]="7000BFC8\n1\tThe Eldgang can be found deep within the Rift of Nûrz Ghâshu. Iorelen has asked you to seek out signs of the Eldgang, the legendary Fire-giants of Nûrz Ghâshu.\t\n2\tTalk to Iorelen\tIorelen is at Iorelen's Camp. You should return to Iorelen with news of what you found within the Rift.\n",
[12080]="70003247\n1\tBring the Elf-stone to Glamír\tGlamír dwells at the ruins north-east of Gondamon, at the southern end of the Grimwater. Gailthin gave you an Elf-stone and sent you to an Elf named Glamír, who may be able to help you against the wights of Haudh Lin.\n",
[12081]="70007314\n1\tBring the Elf-sword to Celairant\030Find Elvellon, the Elf-sword\tThe sword Elvellon can be found at a grave marker amongst the mounds of the Edain, north-east of Gondamon. Celairant is at the hunter's lodge, west of Kheledûl. Penglir has asked you to retrieve a sword which he placed by his companion's grave long ago and take it to Celairant.\n",
[12082]="7002F98D\n1\tAid Nothwulf, of the Elfward, with his concerns\tNothwulf can be found inside the mead hall at the centre of Faldham. Elfmar believes that Nothwulf is distracted by matters that will hinder his skill in the coming battle, and has asked you to help dispatch his concerns.\n2\tTalk to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward\tThane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham. Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Nothwulf's concerns.\n3\tAid Osin, of the Elfward, with his concerns\tOsin can be found outside the mead hall at the centre of Faldham. Thane Elfmar wants Osin's distractions resolved, so that he may focus on the coming White Hand siege.\n4\tSpeak to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward\tThane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham. Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Osin's concerns.\n5\tLangfrith prepares outside of the mead hall at the centre of Faldham. Elfmar believes that Langfrith will be distracted in the coming battle, if his concerns are not first dealt with.\t\n6\tSpeak to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward\tThane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham. Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Lanfrith's concerns.\n",
[12083]="70061FA8\n1\tDefeat luring glooms (total: 10)\tGurthern has asked you to reduce the number of elhudan in Tyrn Gorthad. Tyrn Gorthad is located in north-western Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Gurthern\tYou should let Gurthern know that you have defeated many luring glooms. Gurthern is in Tyrn Gorthad in north-western Cardolan.\n",
[12084]="70016B4B\n1\tTalk to Daegennan in Gwingris\tDaegennan is at Gwingris in Eregion. You were instructed to seek out the Elf Daegennan.\n",
[12085]="7002332C\n1\tTalk to Daegennan in Gwingris\tDaegennan is at Gwingris in Eregion. You were instructed to seek out the Elf Daegennan.\n",
[12086]="7000B405\n1\tSpeak with Imyl of Rivendell.\t\n",
[12087]="7000C69E\n1\tDefeat Bhoghad, Emissary to Goblin-town\tBhoghad is in the Great Goblin's throne room in Goblin-town. Goblin-town lies to the north-east of Glóin's camp. Tralli seemed pleased with all you have done for Glóin in the past and offered you a reward for hunting down and defeating the Uruk-emissary Bhoghad in Goblin-town.\n2\tTalk to Tralli Gemfinder\tTralli Gemfinder is at Glóin's camp in the Misty Mountains, to the south-west of the entrance to Goblin-town. You entered the Great Goblin's throne room and found Bhoghad entreating with the goblins there. You defeated the Uruk and should now return with the news to Tralli Gemfinder.\n",
[12088]="70065569\n1\tTalk to Brunil\tMerenir has asked you to speak with Chief Healer Brunil in Imloth Melui's Hall of the Gentle Hand.\n2\tPick up the note\tBrunil has asked you to pick up the encrypted note. The note is next to Brunil, in the Hall of the Gentle Hand.\n3\tTalk to Atharon\tBrunil has asked you to bring a note written in a medical shorthand to Atharon, who she thinks can decipher the script. Atharon is in the potions wing of the Hall of the Gentle Hand.\n4\tTalk to Brenion\030Talk to Therien\tUpon reading the encrypted note, Atharon has suggested that you check the market to speak with merchants Rendis mentioned she was going to see. You should talk to the bag maker and the provisioner in the Imloth Melui market.\n5\tReturn to Atharon\tAfter speaking with Therien and Brenion, you gained some information about Rendis's actions the day she disappeared. You should let Atharon know what you've learned. Atharon is in the Hall of the Gentle Hand.\n",
[12089]="70042B3C\n1\tTalk to Anlaf the Forlorn in the Forsaken Inn\tAnlaf the Forlorn is the proprietor of the Forsaken Inn, and can be found behind the counter. Bingo is disappointed that the treasure hunt has come to a disappointing end, and is convinced that there is more to the story.\n2\tPick up a box of goods outside the Forsaken Inn\tAnlaf the Forlorn has asked you to carry some of the supplies from outside the Forsaken Inn down to his cellar storage room.\n3\tPick up a basket of eggs outside the Forsaken Inn\tAnlaf the Forlorn has asked you to carry some of the supplies from outside the Forsaken Inn down to his cellar storage room.\n4\tTalk to Anlaf the Forlorn in the Forsaken Inn\tAnlaf the Forlorn will want to hear that you brought the supplies down to his storage room.\n5\tTalk to Bingo in the Forsaken Inn\tBingo is in the Forsaken Inn, wrestling with the meaning of the three words on the parchment you recovered.\n6\tHold the parchment out to the fire in the Forsaken Inn\tBingo has asked you to hold the three-word parchment before the fire in the Forsaken Inn.\n7\tTalk to Bingo in the Forsaken Inn\tBingo is in the Forsaken Inn, in the Lone-lands.\n8\tFind the location mentioned on the three-word parchment and meet Bingo there\tBingo told you that the parchment with THE END NOW written on it contained the location to go next, and he said he would meet you there once you figured it out!\n9\tTalk to Bingo outside the tent in Ost Guruth\tYou deciphered the string of letters on the parchment and followed the clue to Ost Guruth. Bingo is here as well, and wishes to speak to you.\n10\tTalk to Theodore Gorse outside the tent in Ost Guruth\tTheodore Gorse came to Ost Guruth with Bingo, and is excited to meet whoever has been leaving you these riddles.\n11\tTalk to the Master Treasure Seeker\tHaley Meadowsweet is the real Master Treasure Seeker, and is ready to speak with you in Ost Guruth.\n12\tTalk to Theodore Gorse outside the tent in Ost Guruth\tTheodore Gorse is in front of Haley Meadowsweet's tent in Ost Guruth.\n13\tTalk to Bingo outside the tent in Ost Guruth\tBingo is outside Haley Meadowsweet's tent in Ost Guruth.\n",
[12090]="7000014F\n1\tTalk to Hyacinth Took\tHyacinth Took is at her home in Tuckborough near the Great Smials. Paladin Took was grateful for your help destroying the stolen fireworks. He has tasked you with delivering the news to Hyacinth Took.\n",
[12091]="7002F89A\n1\tTalk to the Guard-captain in the merchant-camp\tThe Guard-captain of the trader's outpost can be found outside his tent, within the camp. Ofrith has asked you to discuss the Uruk-hai presence with the Guard-captain and to inquire as to what should be done.\n2\tDiscover the leader of the Uruk-hai camp to the south-east\tThe Uruk-hai camp lies to far to the east and south beyond the river. The Guard-captain has asked you to infiltrate the Uruk-hai establishment and to overthrow the commander of the force.\n3\tDefeat Mauhúr\tThe Uruk-hai camp lies to far to the east and south beyond the river. The Guard-captain has asked you to infiltrate the Uruk-hai encampment and to overthrow the commander of the force.\n4\tReturn to Ofrith at the merchant-camp\tOfrith resides at the trader's outpost, along the road west of Elthengels. Ofrith awaits at the trader outpost for news of your endeavours within the Uruk-hai camp.\n",
[12092]="70037BF2\n1\tCollect Dunlending Weapons (0/6)\tThere are many Dunlending warriors along the perimeter around Brockbridge. You should defeat Dunlending warriors in the perimeter around Brockbridge and collect their weapons.\n2\tCollect Dunlending weapons (total: 6)\tThere are many Dunlending warriors along the perimeter around Brockbridge. You should defeat Dunlending warriors in the perimeter around Brockbridge and collect their weapons.\n3\tPut weapons in the weapon cache\tThe cache of weapons is near Herefara, on the southern side of Brockbridge. You should bring the weapons you collected to the weapons cache in Brockbridge.\n4\tComplete\tWeakening the perimeter gives the town a fighting chance to survive the siege, or at least maintain the stale-mate.\n",
[12093]="7003A693\n1\tDefeat White Hand overseers (0/2) Defeat the White Hand captain\tMate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but it has been uverrun by a party of White Hand warriors from Madh-fushaum.\n2\tDefeat White Hand overseers (total: 2)\030Defeat the White Hand captain\tTwo of the Uruk-hai leaders of the White Hand were seen lashing the Dunlendings in their party who work the mine. The largest Uruk-hai among them is overseeing the mine's operation.\n3\tComplete\tDefeating the Uruk-hai in charge of the mine will disrupt the operations of the mine.\n",
[12094]="70041789\n1\tDefeat the Corsair forces (total: 10)\030Defeat the Corsair Task-master\tThe Corsair ships can be reached using the boat to the south of the Gondorian Captain. You should board the ships and defeat the remaining Corsair forces.\n2\tTalk to Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n",
[12095]="7003E456\n1\tThe creature was thought to have travelled through the western part of Fangorn Forest. You have discovered reminders of a creature that once wandered through Fangorn Forest. You should seek out more signs of its presence.\t\n2\tTalk to Quickbeam's Huorn\tYou have found all the evidence you could find of the mysterious creature that travelled through Fangorn Forest.\n",
[12096]="700453DA\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Maudhúl Grak\tMaudhúl Grak is located in northern Taur Drúadan. You should defeat Orcs at Maudhúl Grak.\n2\tDefeat Orcs at Maudhúl Grak (total: 10)\tMaudhúl Grak is located in northern Taur Drúadan. You should defeat Orcs at Maudhúl Grak.\n3\tCompleted\tYou defeated many Orcs at Maudhúl Grak and thinned out the camp.\n",
})
